  "description": "The Western Shadow Font is a bold, rugged typeface inspired by the Wild West. Perfect for rodeo graphics, cowboy branding, Western t-shirts, rustic signage, and farmhouse decor. This classic cowboy font features shadowed, vintage-style lettering that adds an authentic Western rodeo feel to any design.\nWhether you’re working on Cricut or Silhouette projects, digital designs, or sublimation prints, this font is a great choice for country-themed merchandise, rodeo posters, and rustic farmhouse decor. Ideal for t-shirts, mugs, stickers, tote bags, and cowboy-inspired branding.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>The Western Shadow Font is a bold, rugged typeface inspired by the Wild West. Perfect for rodeo graphics, cowboy branding, Western t-shirts, rustic signage, and farmhouse decor. This classic cowboy font features shadowed, vintage-style lettering that adds an authentic Western rodeo feel to any design.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re working on Cricut or Silhouette projects, digital designs, or sublimation prints, this font is a great choice for country-themed merchandise, rodeo posters, and rustic farmhouse decor. Ideal for t-shirts, mugs, stickers, tote bags, and cowboy-inspired branding.</p>",
